hange":"Austin has warmed, days and nights alike","rain":"Rain: no clear long-term change"},"text":{"lede":"Yesterday's high of 80\u00b0F was the 25th warmest November 13 high (tied) of 129 since 1897, the warmest since 2025.","t_yest":"November 13: warmer than 79% of years","p_yest":"The high of <strong>80\u00b0F</strong> was the 25th warmest November 13 high (tied) of 129 since 1897, the warmest since 2025. The normal high for the date is 72\u00b0F, and the record is 91\u00b0F (1951). The low of <strong>54\u00b0F</strong> was typical for November 13.","t_rec":"Record highs keep coming. Record lows have nearly stopped.","p_rec":"If Austin's climate weren't changing, every year would have the same chance of holding a daily record. Since 2000, Austin has set <strong class=\"sig\">22 standing record lows</strong>, far fewer than the 76 that chance alone would give, and <strong class=\"sig\">217 record highs</strong>, far more than the 76 that chance alone would give. The 2020s hold the most record highs of any decade (95). Austin's all-time high is 112\u00b0F, on September 5, 2000.","t_chg":"Austin has warmed, days and nights alike","p_chg":"Across 125 complete years: Austin's average low has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.23\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.16 to +0.29), about +2.9\u00b0F since 1898. Austin's average high has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.26\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.18 to +0.34), about +3.3\u00b0F since 1898.","t_mon":"Lows rose in 11 of 12 months. Highs rose in 11 of 12 months.","t_rain":"Rain: no clear long-term change","p_rain":"Austin's yearly precipitation shows no clear long-term change (+0.14 inches per decade, a range that includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 36.3 inches a year. The wettest year was 1919 (65.31 in); the driest, 1954 (11.42 in). Austin almost never sees snow (the 1991\u20132020 average is 0.2 inches a winter), so there's no snowfall chart.","show_snow":false,"sig_bars":{"lo":true,"hi":true},"t_year":"2026 so far: 16 daily record highs, 2 daily record lows"}}